Container images
----------------
The Dockerfiles under hangar-runtime build images that bundle third-party
binaries under their own licenses, which apply to anyone who redistributes a
built image:

- hangar-runtime/worker/vllm-omni/video installs PyAV wheels whose bundled
  FFmpeg is built with libx264 (GPL-2.0-or-later). Corresponding source is
  published by the PyAV project (https://github.com/PyAV-Org/pyav-ffmpeg).
- hangar-runtime/worker/vllm/efa installs AWS libfabric and rdma-core
  (BSD/GPL-2.0 dual-licensed).
- hangar-runtime/worker/vllm/nixl-mamba-prefill ships modified vLLM source files
  (Apache-2.0); the modifications are the patches in that directory.
